        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-15" parent="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flusso degli eventi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="370" width="380" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-16" parent="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante “Gestione Profilo”.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema interroga il DBMS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video la schermata “Gestione Profilo” contenente i dati dello &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; studente (Nome, Cognome, Foto, Email, Numero di telefono, Titolo di studio, &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Esperienze lavorative) e il pulsante &quot;Modifica Dati&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Modifica Dati&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video il form di modifica con i campi editabili.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;. L&#39;utente inserisce i nuovi dati .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;. L&#39;utente clicca sul pulsante &quot;Conferma Modifiche&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema invia i nuovi dati aggiornati al DBMS per la sovrascrittura permanente &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;sul database.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra a video il messaggio di conferma: &quot;Modifiche effettuate &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;   &lt;/span&gt;correttamente&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca sul pulsante &quot;ok&quot; per chiudere il messaggio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt;. Il Sistema mostra nuovamente la schermata &quot;Gestione Profilo&quot; aggiornata con i &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; nuovi valori.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="410" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="370" width="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-17" parent="-HUbU5_3fMQypcDHfZAv-1" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" vertex="1">
