        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QUuvt9lHnHT5mBKgE8wx-15" parent="QUuvt9lHnHT5mBKgE8wx-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Flusso degli eventi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="290" width="380" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QUuvt9lHnHT5mBKgE8wx-16" parent="QUuvt9lHnHT5mBKgE8wx-14" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca su &quot;+&quot; accanto ad un file&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;Il sistema mostra un menu a tendina con varie voci&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente seleziona la voce &quot;ELIMINA FILE&quot;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;. Il sistema mostra a schermo una finestra in cui è presente un messaggio:&quot;sei &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;sicuro di voler rimuovere il seguente file, l&#39;azione sarà irreversibile&quot;,un &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;pulsante &quot;conferma &quot; ed il pulsante &quot;annulla&quot;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;. Lo studente clicca il pulsante &quot;Conferma&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; Il sistema chiude la finestra contenente il messaggio&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;SE &lt;/b&gt;la cancellazione del file è andata a buon fine&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;7.1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Il sistema aggiorna il DBMS eliminando il file.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;7.2 &lt;/b&gt;Il sistema mostra a schermo &quot;file eliminato correttamente&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;7.3 &lt;/b&gt;Lo studente clicca &quot;OK&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;7.4 &lt;/b&gt;Il sistema mostra a schermo la schermata con tutti i file caricati&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;b&gt;ALTRIMENTI&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;8.1 &lt;/b&gt;Il sistema mostra a schermo un messaggio di errore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;8.2 &lt;/b&gt;L&#39;utente clicca &quot;OK&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;8.3 &lt;/b&gt;Il sistema mostra a schermo la schermata con tutti i file caricati&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="410" x="380" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="290" width="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
